---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/projects.css';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="projects-page">

    <section class="projects-hero">
      <p class="projects-label">Selected work</p>

      <h1>Projects</h1>

      <p class="projects-intro">
        A selection of projects that started with a problem and an idea for a solution,
        usually before I knew how to build it.
      </p>
    </section>


    <section class="project-index">

      <a class="project-row" href="/projects/hugin">
        <div class="project-index-number">01</div>

        <div class="project-index-main">
          <p class="project-type">
            Embedded systems · Home automation
          </p>

          <h2>Hugin</h2>

          <p class="project-summary">
            A room sensor platform I started building when I couldn't find
            a ready-made solution that combined the sensors and local control I wanted.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="project-index-meta">
          <span>ESP32-C6</span>
          <span>ESPHome</span>
          <span>Home Assistant</span>
        </div>

        <div class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      </a>


      <a class="project-row" href="/projects/homelab">
        <div class="project-index-number">02</div>

        <div class="project-index-main">
          <p class="project-type">
            Linux · Networking · Self-hosting
          </p>

          <h2>Homelab</h2>

          <p class="project-summary">
            What started as a home server grew into an environment for running
            my own services and learning Linux, Docker, networking and automation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="project-index-meta">
          <span>Linux</span>
          <span>Docker</span>
          <span>UniFi</span>
        </div>

        <div class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      </a>


      <a class="project-row" href="/projects/bachelor-project">
        <div class="project-index-number">03</div>

        <div class="project-index-main">
          <p class="project-type">
            Chalmers · Networking · Software development
          </p>

          <h2>Bachelor Project</h2>

          <p class="project-summary">
            A six-person Chalmers project where we researched, designed and built
            a network-based approach to detecting when shared computers stopped reporting.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="project-index-meta">
          <span>Go</span>
          <span>Java</span>
          <span>Spring Boot</span>
        </div>

        <div class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      </a>

    </section>


    <section class="projects-closing">
      <span>More on GitHub</span>

      <p>
        The portfolio focuses on the ideas and decisions behind each project.
        The code, configuration and more technical details live on GitHub.
      </p>

      <a
        href="https://github.com/Pdoxxy"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        View on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
